        {
          "line": 9,
          "upper": false,
          "native_dialogue": {
            "source_dat": "FDTXT_026",
            "string_index": 9,
            "utterance": 9,
            "control": "FFEE",
            "operand": 24,
            "pages": [
              [
                "『這傢伙的話還真是難懂．約",
                "　拿老頭，你聽懂了多少？』"
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "line": 10,
          "upper": false,
          "native_dialogue": {
            "source_dat": "FDTXT_026",
            "string_index": 9,
            "utterance": 10,
            "control": "FFEE",
            "operand": 21,
            "pages": [
              [
                "『我只知道這位渥德老兄好像",
                "　並未參與這次的攻擊，不過",
                "　一切麻煩的根源似乎都來自"
              ],
              [
                "　所謂的「第一空中要塞」，",
                "　它也可能就是「黃金的城堡",
                "　」，由古代人所建造的．飛"
              ],
              [
                "　行堡疊，兼具建造機甲兵的",
                "　能力．．』"
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "line": 11,
          "upper": false,
          "native_dialogue": {
            "source_dat": "FDTXT_026",
            "string_index": 9,
            "utterance": 11,
            "control": "FFEE",
            "operand": 26,
            "pages": [
              [
                "『古代人不是早在數萬年前的",
                "　最終戰爭中就死光了嗎？為",
                "　什麼這個要塞還能發動攻擊"
              ],
              [
                "　？』"
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "line": 12,
          "upper": false,
          "native_dialogue": {
            "source_dat": "FDTXT_026",
            "string_index": 9,
            "utterance": 12,
            "control": "FFEE",
            "operand": 0,
            "pages": [
              [
                "『這個「黃金城」會不會是由",
                "　類似的機甲兵所控制，由於",
                "　沒有收到所謂的中止作戰指"
              ],
              [
                "　令，所以仍在執行以前的作",
                "　戰行動？』"
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "line": 13,
          "upper": false,
          "native_dialogue": {
            "source_dat": "FDTXT_026",
            "string_index": 9,
            "utterance": 13,
            "control": "FFEE",
            "operand": 6,
            "pages": [
              [
                "『很有可能，古代人建造這種",
                "　飛行要塞，主要目的應該就",
                "　是空中制壓和對地攻擊，但"
              ],
              [
                "　最終戰爭早在數萬年前就已",
                "　經結束了，為何到現在才又",
                "　開始行動？』"
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "line": 14,
          "upper": false,
          "native_dialogue": {
            "source_dat": "FDTXT_026",
            "string_index": 9,
            "utterance": 14,
            "control": "FFEE",
            "operand": 21,
            "pages": [
              [
                "『看來只有上黃金城一趟，這",
                "　一切的謎題才能夠解開！渥",
                "　德，你所說的轉送站在哪裡",
                "　？』"
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "line": 15,
          "upper": true,
          "native_dialogue": {
            "source_dat": "FDTXT_026",
            "string_index": 9,
            "utterance": 15,
            "control": "FFEF",
            "operand": 31,
            "pages": [
              [
                "『就位在這地下通道的出口處",
                "　。』"
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "line": 16,
          "upper": false,
          "native_dialogue": {
            "source_dat": "FDTXT_026",
            "string_index": 9,
            "utterance": 16,
            "control": "FFEE",
            "operand": 0,
            "pages": [
              [
                "『好，那就一鼓作氣衝過去，",
                "　我們這就走吧！悠妮，跟著",
                "　我！』"
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "line": 17,
          "upper": false,
          "native_dialogue": {
            "source_dat": "FDTXT_026",
            "string_index": 9,
            "utterance": 17,
            "control": "FFEE",
            "operand": 9,
            "pages": [
              [
                "『．．．』"
              ]
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "0x24fc4#8": {
      "script": "ch26.json",
      "scene_index": 2,
      "lines": [
        {
          "line": 11,
          "upper": false,
          "native_dialogue": {
            "source_dat": "FDTXT_026",
            "string_index": 8,
            "utterance": 0,
            "control": "FFEE",
            "operand": 0,
            "pages": [
              [
                "『亞奇梅吉，夠了！你要是把",
                "　她弄哭了，我絕不饒你！』"
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "line": 12,
          "upper": false,
          "native_dialogue": {
            "source_dat": "FDTXT_026",
            "string_index": 8,
            "utterance": 1,
            "control": "FFEE",
            "operand": 21,
            "pages": [
              [
                "『．算啦，不要逼問她了，反",
                "　正上了黃金城，相信一切的",
                "　謎題自然都會解開的！』"
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "line": 13,
          "upper": false,
          "native_dialogue": {
            "source_dat": "FDTXT_026",
            "string_index": 8,
            "utterance": 2,
            "control": "FFEE",
            "operand": 0,
            "pages": [
              [
                "『好，那就一鼓作氣衝過去，",
                "　我們這就走吧！悠妮，跟著",
                "　我！』"
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "line": 14,
          "upper": false,
          "native_dialogue": {
            "source_dat": "FDTXT_026",
            "string_index": 8,
            "utterance": 3,
            "control": "FFEE",
            "operand": 0,
            "pages": [
              [
                "『．．．』"
              ]
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "0x24fff#10": {
      "script": "ch26.json",
      "scene_index": 4,
      "lines": [
        {
          "line": 0,
          "upper": false,
          "native_dialogue": {
            "source_dat": "FDTXT_026",
            "string_index": 10,
            "utterance": 0,
            "control": "FFEE",
            "operand": 0,
            "pages": [
              [
                "『悠妮，怎麼了？是不是．我",
                "　的口氣太粗魯了？對不起！",
                "　』"
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "line": 1,
          "upper": false,
          "native_dialogue": {
            "source_dat": "FDTXT_026",
            "string_index": 10,
            "utterance": 1,
            "control": "FFEE",
            "operand": 9,
            "pages": [
              [
                "『不是的，索爾，我好迷惑．",
                "　．我到底是誰？這一切．到",
                "　底和我有什麼關連？我真的"
              ],
              [
                "　不知道．我好怕我會給你帶",
                "　來災禍，也許一開始你就不",
                "　該救我的．．』"
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "line": 2,
          "upper": false,
          "native_dialogue": {
            "source_dat": "FDTXT_026",
            "string_index": 10,
            "utterance": 2,
            "control": "FFEE",
            "operand": 0,
            "pages": [
              [
                "『悠妮，我永遠都會相信妳的",
                "　！只要有妳和我在一起，我",
                "　什麼也不怕！我們不是都來"
              ],
              [
                "　到這裡了嗎？』"
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "line": 3,
          "upper": false,
          "native_dialogue": {
            "source_dat": "FDTXT_026",
            "string_index": 10,
            "utterance": 3,
            "control": "FFEE",
            "operand": 9,
            "pages": [
              [
                "『可是．可是．』"
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "line": 4,
          "upper": false,
          "native_dialogue": {
            "source_dat": "FDTXT_026",
            "string_index": 10,
            "utterance": 4,
            "control": "FFEE",
            "operand": 0,
            "pages": [
              [
                "『剛才的事就當它沒發生過，",
                "　來，我們一起走過去！』"
              ]
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "0x2503a#11": {
      "script": "ch26.json",
      "scene_index": 4,
      "lines": [
        {
          "line": 5,
          "upper": false,
          "native_dialogue": {
            "source_dat": "FDTXT_026",
            "string_index": 11,
            "utterance": 0,
            "control": "FFEE",
            "operand": 24,
            "pages": [
              [
                "『其貫亞奇梅吉說的也沒錯．",
                "　這樣子好嗎？』"
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "line": 6,
          "upper": false,
          "native_dialogue": {
            "source_dat": "FDTXT_026",
            "string_index": 11,
            "utterance": 1,
            "control": "FFEE",
            "operand": 21,
            "pages": [
              [
                "『這個年輕人得到神的庇佑，",
                "　我想我們應該尊重他的決定",
                "　．不多說了，我們走吧！』"
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "line": 7,
          "upper": false,
          "native_dialogue": {
            "source_dat": "FDTXT_026",
            "string_index": 11,
            "utterance": 2,
            "control": "FFEE",
            "operand": 29,
            "pages": [
              [
                "『也只能這樣了！』"
              ]
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  },
